Module 4: UPLIFT VENTURES — Entrepreneurship & Economic Development
Tagline: "From idea to impact. Build Black. Buy Black. Grow Black."

Problem Statement
Black-founded startups received just 0.4% of all U.S. venture capital in 2024 — $730 million of $314 billion total — the lowest share in years and down more than two-thirds from three years prior. Only 17% of Black-founded deals reach Series A, compared to 37.7% for startups overall. Beyond VC, Black business owners face systematic barriers in accessing SBA loans, establishing supplier diversity relationships, and finding mentors with relevant networks. Black entrepreneurship is growing at the fastest pace in 30 years, yet wide divides persist across revenue, debt, business size, and market access. The infrastructure to support Black entrepreneurs from idea to scale simply does not exist at the level required.

Core Features
Feature	Description
Business Plan Builder with AI Assistance	Guided, step-by-step business plan creation with AI-powered suggestions for market analysis, financial projections, and competitive positioning. Templates for different business types (service, product, tech, nonprofit). Export to PDF/DOCX for lender and investor submissions.
Grant & Microloan Finder	Searchable database of grants, microloans, pitch competitions, and accelerator programs specifically available to Black entrepreneurs. AI-matched recommendations based on business type, stage, location, and revenue. Application deadline tracking and document preparation checklists.
Mentor/Advisor Matching Engine	Connects founders with experienced entrepreneurs, industry advisors, and subject-matter experts. Matching criteria include industry, business stage, geographic proximity, and specific needs (marketing, finance, operations, legal). Advisory board formation tools.
Supplier Diversity Marketplace	Platform connecting Black-owned businesses with corporations and government agencies seeking diverse suppliers. Certification verification (MBE, DBE, SBE), capability profiles, RFP matching, and bid management tools.
Business Analytics Dashboard	Revenue tracking, expense monitoring, customer metrics, and growth analytics for small businesses. Integrates with Stripe/Square for real-time sales data. Benchmarking against peer businesses (anonymized).
Co-Working & Resource Space Locator	Map of co-working spaces, maker spaces, commercial kitchens, and other shared business resources. Filters by cost, amenities, availability, and Black-owned status. Booking integration.
Pitch Preparation Tools	Pitch deck builder with templates, AI feedback on pitch scripts, and video practice with community peer review. Investor database with warm introduction pathways and pitch competition calendar.
Black Business Directory & Discovery Engine	Consumer-facing directory of Black-owned businesses searchable by category, location, and ratings. Business claim and profile management. "Buy Black" campaign integration and seasonal promotional tools.
User Stories
As a first-time founder with a food truck concept, I want to build a business plan with AI guidance and find relevant grants so that I can launch without predatory financing.
As a Black-owned IT consultancy, I want to list my business in the supplier diversity marketplace so that I can access corporate and government procurement opportunities.
As an aspiring entrepreneur in college, I want to be matched with a mentor who has built a business in my target industry so that I learn from real experience, not just textbooks.
As a consumer, I want to discover Black-owned businesses near me by category so that I can direct my purchasing power toward community economic development.
